# W2, b (k2): onto the lobby gate's mat while a's instance runs in stag0101, A on the gate's first line (stag0101): the
# gate form holds the press and opens the prompt (a's row); B (DW4_ONLINE_AUTOCHOICE=back) goes to the game, whose own
# cancel closes the destination menu. b stands at the gate with control in its lobby: no BARRIER, nothing loaded.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@120
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 0 until frames>=150
shot w2_gate_prompt
idle until frames>=300
log b answered the prompt
idle until frames>=900 fail stage=stag0101
idle until stage=stagml11,control
log b stands at the gate
